star-suite (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Feature release for native CBQ/BINSEQ input support.
  * Add the native C++ CBQ reader, STAR read-buffer adapter, process_features
    adapter coverage, and an order-preserving FASTQ/FASTQ.gz-to-CBQ encoder.
  * Wire CBQ input through STAR mapper, STARsolo, OCM, Flex, and SLAM smoke
    coverage, including paired-end SLAM divergence checks.
  * Register CBQ module, production-local, and network-backed regression cases
    in the production module manifest.
  * Report STAR Suite 1.1.0 from STAR --version.

 -- STAR-suite Maintainers <maintainers@biodepot.example>  Fri, 29 May 2026 19:20:00 +0000

star-suite (1.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Hotfix non-Flex Solo bridge determinism by canonicalizing worker-local
    bridge hash entries before collapse.
  * Aggregate ambiguous cell-barcode evidence deterministically before
    Bayesian resolution and use the resolved bridge result for read-accounting
    statistics.
  * Add an A375 repeat-run bridge determinism harness for production-scale
    matrix and stats parity checks.
  * Report STAR Suite 1.0.3 from STAR --version.

